# Served by the Worker with every page (Cloudflare static assets). The page's own policy (which servers it may
# talk to) is the <meta> in index.html, so the GitHub Pages copy carries it too; these are the header-only parts.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors *
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
